# Story 23: Context Store (40s)
# Hook: Store project context once, recall it anytime. Your AI remembers.
# Duration: 40s
# Source: story-23-context-store.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 8

[00:00.0 --> 00:04.0]
Start rysh -- you land in shell mode.

[00:04.0 --> 00:08.0]
Double-press Escape to enter prompt mode.

[00:08.0 --> 00:18.0]
Tell the AI to store important project context. It saves to a persistent context store.

[00:18.0 --> 00:23.0]
The AI confirms the context is stored.

[00:23.0 --> 00:33.0]
Now recall it. The AI retrieves from the context store and gives you the info back.

[00:33.0 --> 00:38.0]
There it is -- PostgreSQL on port 5433. Stored once, available anytime.

[00:38.0 --> 00:43.0]
You can also check all stored project notes at once.

[00:43.0 --> 00:48.0]
Context store -- your AI's persistent memory.

